<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px;">
  <h2 style="background-color:#e53935;color:#fff;padding:16px;">
    Action Required: Smart Router App Access Suspended
  </h2>

  <p>Hi <%= employeeName %> (<%= employeeCode %>),</p>

  <p>
    Your Smart Router app access has been disabled due to reaching the monthly no-show limit
    according to your company's transport policy.
  </p>

  <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Employee Name</strong></td>
      <td><%= employeeName %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Employee Code</strong></td>
      <td><%= employeeCode %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Team</strong></td>
      <td><%= teamName %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Process</strong></td>
      <td><%= processName %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Date &amp; Time</strong></td>
      <td><%= dateTime %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Monthly No-Show Count</strong></td>
      <td><%= noShowCount %></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top:16px;">
    Your count will reset automatically next month. To restore Smart Router app access earlier,
    please contact the Transport Help Desk.
  </p>

  <p>Best regards,<br />Smart Router Team</p>
</body>

</html>